WEBVTT

00:00:00.587 --> 00:00:01.270
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.175 --> 00:00:04.911
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> People walk <b>more quickly than</b> in the past.

00:00:06.979 --> 00:00:07.597
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.664 --> 00:00:12.880
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> My brother speaks English, but <b>less fluently than</b> me.

00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:15.558
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.705 --> 00:00:19.185
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> She doesn’t drive <b>as fast as</b> her brother.